<title>USA: Brandywine Realty Trust increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>Brandywine Realty Trust increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said Monday it had increased its quarterly dividend to $0.36 per share from $0.35, payable July 10, record June 30.</p>
</text>
